## DOI Strategy

All dispatches will be truth-tested and registered via [Zenodo](https://zenodo.org) for scholarly legitimacy. Each object will carry a persistent identifier and be mapped to public-facing resonance across institutional libraries, including potential anchoring within University of Toronto Libraries (UTL).

